{
  "_comment": [
    "Makes the graphical installer GXWI's overlay: everyone who opens the",
    "machine's address is sent to it, with no logon, as the live medium's",
    "peios account, which has no credential.",
    "",
    "For an install medium only. An image lists it in [registry]",
    "live_autoapply, which installerd never copies to the disk it installs",
    "(settle_seed_queues), and never in autoapply: on an installed machine",
    "the address would stay the installer, not the logon page.",
    "",
    "Shipped by dev.peios.installer-gxwi into /usr/share/regim/."
  ],
  "keys": [
    {
      "path": "Machine\\Software",
      "values": []
    },
    {
      "path": "Machine\\Software\\GXWI",
      "values": [
        {
          "name": "OverlayUsername",
          "type": "sz",
          "data": "peios"
        },
        {
          "name": "OverlaySession",
          "type": "sz",
          "data": "/usr/bin/installer-gxwi"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
